<h2>Skill Deep Dive &mdash; Overview</h2>
<p>This material organizes the <strong>"Skill Deep Dive / Taein Kim"</strong> course paragraph by paragraph, in order. <strong>Learning how to use skills takes all of five minutes</strong> &mdash; it is that easy. So this course focuses less on usage and more on <strong>the concept of a skill and the philosophy and ideas that drive it</strong>.</p>

