<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">Why learn it deeply</span>
    Understanding skills properly helps a great deal in grasping <strong>not just a single technique but the whole ecosystem</strong> in your future work and in applying generative AI. The <a href="#!hns-overview">harness</a> that comes next is, in a way, <strong>a kind of meta skill</strong>, so having the concept of skills down makes that material much clearer too.
</div>

<h3>What this document set covers</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The background from which skills were born &mdash; the <strong>coding agent</strong></li>
    <li>The concept of skills and their strengths</li>
    <li>The context window and the principle of <strong>progressive loading</strong></li>
    <li>The <code>SKILL.md</code> structure and writing the description</li>
    <li>Example skills, hands-on installation and use, <strong>security cautions</strong></li>
    <li>Building skills (skill engineering) and a summary of the engineering layers</li>
</ul>

